  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names Rebuilding Mount Dongshan as already refined and hidden in Hai Shi blessed land, and says he could enter the blessed land and exchange an Immortal Gu for it.",
      "chapters": [
        425
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_rebuilding_mount_dongshan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan again places Rebuilding Mount Dongshan in Eastern Sea’s Hai Shi blessed land. He compares another opponent as easier than the veteran Sun Cu and that group of Gu Immortals in Hai Shi blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        545
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_sun_cu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tells Tai Bai Yun Sheng that among the five great trading markets in the world, treasure yellow heaven is first and Hai Shi blessed land is second, and that Hai Shi should have missions for saving air bubble sea. He also asks Tai Bai Yun Sheng to look for laughter stones and other materials in Hai Shi blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        673
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "market-among-five",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan understands Hai Shi blessed land as the biggest lone cultivator force in eastern sea. Most who join are lone cultivators, unlike Northern Plains’ Snowy Mountain blessed land as a demonic path base; Hai Shi mixes demonic and righteous path members, holds more Gu Immortals than Snowy Mountain, and has many factions that together control the largest market in eastern sea, making it the most popular spot for Gu Immortals to sell loot. Tai Bai Yun Sheng reports Gu Immortals have invited him to join, subject to half the elders agreeing, and that he bought underworld jellyfish there.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lone-cultivator-market-force",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_snowy_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Man as Before is exposed during the Yu Lu blessed land attempt, Shark Demon invites Tai Bai Yun Sheng to Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance; Tai Bai Yun Sheng refuses that base and instead is hosted by Shark Demon and two other immortal zombies in Hai Shi blessed land, where he hears news of a method that can break free of an immortal zombie body.",
      "chapters": [
        746
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tai-bai-yun-sheng-visit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_man_as_before",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As Fang Yuan instructed, Tai Bai Yun Sheng first takes tasks of restoring sea areas in Hai Shi blessed land, makes a name, and only then connects to Shark Demon and others; attempts at attacking Yu Lu blessed land include him, and Shark Demon and his wife treat him well because of Man as Before paired with Shark Demon’s time anchor Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        819
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hai-shi-task-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
